    "chunk_text": "Current progress: Preparation of tender and legal documents for the construction of one hostel is currently underway.\n\nHostel types: 04 Model A hostels (400 students each) and 03 Model B hostels (200 students each).\n\nHostel types: 03 Model A hostels (400 students each) and 03 Model B hostels (200 students each).\n\nCurrent progress: A pre-bid meeting with construction companies has been held for one hostel project, and quotations were called on May 22, 2026.\n\nHostel types: 02 Model A hostels (400 students each) and 02 Model B hostels (200 students each).\n\nCurrent progress: A Technical Evaluation Report for one hostel project is currently being prepared.\n\nCurrent progress: Bids for one hostel project were opened on May 17, 2026.\n\nHostel types: 02 Model A hostels (400 students each) and 02 Model B hostels (200 students each).\n\nCurrent progress: Preparation of tender documents for one hostel project is underway.\n\nCurrent progress: Preliminary work has commenced at the construction site for one hostel, and 75% of the land preparation work has been completed.\n\nCurrent progress: Quotations for the construction of one hostel on a design-and-build basis were invited between April 9 and May 27, 2026.\n\nCurrent progress: Site selection for the construction of one hostel is underway, while the design and construction methodology has already been approved."
