    "md5": "2ae2c9790807a435a7c4495b8094a907",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1805,
    "chunk_text": "Complementing the group\u2019s logistics capabilities is Abanchy Ceylon, which provides smart, reliable freight solutions by air, sea, and land. Over the past year, Abanchy has expanded into the East African market, thereby broadening the group\u2019s logistics reach covering three continents.\n\nContinental Freight (Pvt) Ltd, the group\u2019s newly incorporated logistics entity, is focused on building a strong global agency network through partnerships with international shipping liners, non-vessel operating common carriers (NVOCCs), and freight forwarding companies.\n\nServing food and retail sector are the entities T Co by Adra and Continental Food Products (Pvt) Ltd.\u00a0 T Co, the group\u2019s premium caf\u00e9 and lifestyle brand, continues to grow with plans to expand to five key tourist destinations in the country.\n\nContinental Food Products (Pvt) Ltd, a recently incorporated venture, is the group\u2019s entry into large-scale food manufacturing. Designed to meet the growing demand for quality, affordable food solutions, the company focuses on efficient production, consistent standards, and reliable distribution to local and institutional customers.\n\nPink Panda, the group\u2019s digital convenience platform, extends local focus further as a modern online marketplace designed for the evolving needs of Sri Lankan consumers. Having commenced with food distribution, the platform has plans to expand into other categories, under one ecosystem for greater convenience and accessibility.\n\nWith a diversified portfolio and new ventures incorporated each year, Pink Eagle Holdings is forging pathways into the global arena, with the ambition to become a globally recognised Sri Lankan conglomerate delivering sustainable growth, empowering communities, and setting new benchmarks on the world stage is on course."
