    "chunk_text": "A technology entrepreneur and innovation advocate, Wegapitiya has built an international career spanning Management & Finance, Global Marketing, Information Technology, and Digital Transformation. Over the past decade, he has worked with globally renowned organisations including Warner Bros. Interactive Entertainment, Deutsche Bank, Virtusa Corporation, and Ve Interactive, serving markets across Sri Lanka, the Asia-Pacific region, and the Americas.\n\nNiroshan J Pieries, meanwhile, brings over two decades of professional experience across sectors including energy, lubricants, logistics, telecommunications, banking, insurance, and customer service. Having held several senior leadership positions within the Laugfs Group, he has played a pivotal role in driving business transformation, strategic leadership, operational excellence, and brand development across multiple business sectors.\n\nIn addition to his corporate responsibilities, Pieries contributes actively towards academia as a Senior Lecturer in Management and Leadership at several local and international institutions, supporting the development of future business professionals and emerging leaders."
