    "md5": "0972070e43db7b98360f918401f41ddc",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1944,
    "chunk_text": "Vella inks US $ 5.1mn BOI pact to elevate  98 Acres Resort into global luxury benchmark\n\nFrom left: Vella co-founder and Director Ranga Abeyrathne, co-founder and Director Eranda Abeyrathne, BOI Acting Chairman Dr. Sulakshana Jayawardena and Director General Renuka Weerakone\n\nUva Greenlands Estate (Pvt.) Ltd officially signed a landmark agreement with the Board of Investment of Sri Lanka (BOI) on May 29, 2026, setting the stage for a major evolution of 98 Acres Resort & Spa in the breathtaking highlands of Ella.\n\nThe visionary US $ 5.1 million investment is strategically designed to position both Ella and the resort on the world map as a benchmark for global luxury.\n\nThe transformative project aims to redefine the boundaries of ultra-luxury hospitality in Sri Lanka, helping to cement the island\u2019s reputation as a premier destination for discerning global travellers.\n\nScheduled to unfold across two phases over the next 36 months, the expansion will create approximately 150 direct employment opportunities. This development is expected to generate a meaningful economic impact for the Uva region and reinforce Sri Lanka\u2019s standing as a high-value tourism economy.\n\nThe initiative marks the second BOI project under the Vella group\u2019s travel and tourism sector, further solidifying its growing presence in Sri Lanka\u2019s luxury hospitality landscape.\n\nThe group\u2019s first BOI venture, the acclaimed Ravana Pool Club in Ella, is an award-winning landmark that has already set a compelling standard for experiential hospitality on the world stage.\n\nWith the upcoming expansion of 98 Acres Resort & Spa, the group is poised to build on that success and once again raise the bar for world-class tourism in the country.\n\n\u201cWe believe it is our shared responsibility to elevate Sri Lanka\u2019s tourism industry to the next level,\u201d stated Vella Director and co-founder Eranda Abeyratne, capturing the core vision behind the investment."
