    "chunk_size_bytes": 541,
    "chunk_text": "Buddha Rashmi Vesak Zone concludes in Colombo\n\nOpposition Leader Sajith Premadasa declared open the final day of the Buddha Rashmi Vesak Zone at Colombo\u2019s Gangaramaya Temple on June 2, 2026. The event, jointly organized by the Hunupitiya Gangaramaya Temple, the Presidential Secretariat, and the Prime Minister\u2019s Office, was attended by Ven. Dr. Pallegama Rathanasara Thero of Gangaramaya Temple. Deputy Minister of Digital Economy Eranga Weeraratne and Member of Parliament Harshan Rajakaruna were also present. Pix by Pradeep Pathirana"
