    "md5": "ac8b5872189e21c82b546ca037a3d8d1",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1816,
    "chunk_text": "Meridian Creative Solutions founder and Director Viraj Adhihetty said the goal is not to reject automation but to restore context to a process that has become overly keyword-driven.\n\n\u201cAutomation and AI absolutely have a place in modern hiring,\u201d he said.\n\nMeridian Talent\u2019s approach is built on three core principles: real specialist understanding of roles and team context, chemistry and culture fit alongside capability and a respect-driven process that treats candidates as partners.\n\nRather than relying solely on job descriptions, the firm spends time understanding how a business actually functions: delivery pressures, team dynamics, role expectations and future direction.\n\nThe firm focuses on specialist mid-to-senior placements, serving employers across Sri Lanka, the Asia-Pacific region and globally. Meridian Talent operates on a no- placement-no-fee basis, with clear terms designed to remove risk for employers and incentivise long-term fit.\n\nThe employers can initiate a search by filling out a detailed requirements form on the Meridian Talent website or reaching out via email. Following an onboarding call or meeting to clarify the requirements and align expectations, Meridian Talent curates a shortlist of pre-screened candidates with structured screening notes and recommendations based on comprehensive initial interviews. The employers typically receive a carefully considered shortlist within an average of seven days.\n\nMeridian Talent is backed by Meridian Creative Solutions, a tech-enabled business consultancy that has built and scaled development operations for over seven years. This operational foundation gives Meridian Talent a practical vantage point on what \u2018good\u2019 looks like in real teams and why alignment at the point of recruitment shapes delivery, culture and trust."
