    "chunk_text": "Vested interests behind extension of judicial officers\u2019 retirement age\n\nColombo, June 3 (Daily Mirror) - The government\u2019s move towards extending the retirement age of the judges by two years is aimed at satisfying a few persons and thereby inflicting undue influence on the judiciary, the Samagi Jana Balawegaya (SJB) said in a statement today.\n\n\u201cThe retirement age of the judicial officers is stipulated by the Constitution and therefore the retirement age has to be changed through a Constitutional amendment,\u201d the party also said."
