    "description": "From Eelam War Heroes to Disposable Mercenaries: Sri Lankan Combatants Fighting in the Ukrainian War",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/From-Eelam-War-Heroes-to-Disposable-Mercenaries-Sri-Lankan-Combatants-Fighting-in-the-Ukrainian-War/172-341932",
