    "chunk_text": "Fire at Horana elders\u2019 home kills 11 people\n\nColombo, June 4 (Daily Mirror) - A total of 11 people have been confirmed dead following a massive fire that broke out at an elders\u2019 home in Anguruwatota, Horana on Tuesday evening, police said.\n\nThree other residents remain unaccounted for, while seven injured individuals have been admitted to the Horana District Hospital for treatment.\n\nAccording to authorities, 72 residents were at the facility when the blaze erupted.\n\nPolice said investigations are continuing to determine the cause of the fire, while search efforts remain underway for the three missing residents."
