    "chunk_text": "Death toll rises to 12 in Horana elders\u2019 home fire\n\nColombo, June 4 (Daily Mirror) - The death toll from the fire that broke out at an elders\u2019 home in Anguruwatota, Horana, on Tuesday evening has risen to 12, police said.\n\nAuthorities said three residents are still unaccounted for, while seven injured individuals have been admitted to Horana District Hospital for treatment.\n\nAccording to officials, 72 residents were inside the facility when the blaze erupted.\n\nRescue teams managed to evacuate 44 occupants safely without injuries, officials added."
