    "chunk_text": "Iran\u2019s IRGC says \u2018no peace in region\u2019 without Israeli withdrawal from Lebanon\n\nAl Jazeera - Iran\u2019s Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) says there will be \u201cno peace in the region\u201d without Israel\u2019s withdrawal from Lebanese territory.\n\n\u201cOur initial condition for accepting a ceasefire in the regional war has been a ceasefire on all fronts, including Lebanon,\u201d the IRGC said in a statement shared by Iran\u2019s Tasnim news agency.\n\n\u201cThe enemy must urgently stop its attacks on the Lebanese people, and immediately withdraw behind international borders by evacuating the occupied territories of Lebanon, and recognise the territorial integrity of Lebanon.\u201d"
